    "detailed_description": "&quot;EYE TO ME&quot; is an adventure game set in the modern era.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6 Story<br />\r\n<br />\r\nI am creating your &quot;video game.&quot;<br />\r\nI am showing &quot;it&quot; while eating fries at the store.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nWhy? How come?<br />\r\n<br />\r\n&quot;I just wanted a place where I could talk a little about my memories with you.&quot;<br />\r\n<br />\r\nI see, that sounds nice.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nYou stare at me with big eye.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEYE, EYE, EYE.<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6 Game Features<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- A walking simulator where various events occur as you walk.<br />\r\n- Progress the story by examining objects.<br />\r\n- No quest markers or time limits, allowing for relaxed gameplay.<br />\r\n- A large &quot;eye&quot; is staring at me.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlaytime: 10 to 30 minutes<br />\r\n<br />\r\n\u25c6 Streaming Guidelines<br />\r\n<br />\r\n- Streaming is allowed without prior permission for both individuals and organizations.",
